@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(c)(6) (src:1359)
GIVEN `the date the Secretary of State received the service of process` IS A DATE
      `the day in question` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(c)(6) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` MEANS
    `the day in question` GREATER THAN (`the date` (`period in years` 5) `after` `the date the Secretary of State received the service of process`)

§ `s 266(d) The corporation ceases to exist as a corporation of this State`

-- Upon the filing of the certificate of conversion in accordance with (c), or on its future effective date or time, and payment to the Secretary of State of all fees prescribed under the title,
-- the corporation ceases to exist as a corporation of this State at the time the certificate becomes effective in accordance with section 103 (piece dg1: the date is an input; the fees: section 391, piece dg11).
-- src:1361 | (d) Upon the filing in the Office of the Secretary of State of a certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity in accordance with subsection (c) of this section or upon the future effective date or time of the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity and payment to the Secretary of State of all fees prescribed under this title, the corporation shall cease to exist as a corporation of this State at the time the certificate of conversion becomes effective in accordance with § 103 of this title. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(d) (src:1361)
GIVEN `the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity was filed in accordance with subsection (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `all fees prescribed under the title have been paid to the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 391 (piece dg11)
      `the date on which the certificate of conversion becomes effective in accordance with § 103` IS A DATE -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
      `the day in question` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(d) the corporation has ceased to exist as a corporation of this State` MEANS
        `the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity was filed in accordance with subsection (c)`
    AND `all fees prescribed under the title have been paid to the Secretary of State`
    AND `the day in question` AT LEAST `the date on which the certificate of conversion becomes effective in accordance with § 103`

-- "A copy of the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity certified by the Secretary of State shall be prima facie evidence of the conversion by such corporation out of the State of Delaware."
-- src:1361 | A copy of the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity certified by the Secretary of State shall be prima facie evidence of the conversion by such corporation out of the State of Delaware.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(d) (src:1361)
GIVEN `the copy of the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity is certified by the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(d) the copy is prima facie evidence of the conversion out of the State of Delaware` MEANS
    `the copy of the certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity is certified by the Secretary of State`

§ `s 266(e) Obligations, liabilities and choice of law before the conversion`

-- The conversion out of Delaware and the cessation of existence as a corporation of this State are not deemed to affect an obligation or liability incurred before it, or a person's personal liability
-- incurred before it. The subsection says nothing of those incurred afterwards: that case is not covered (NOTHING).
-- src:1362 | (e) The conversion of a corporation out of the State of Delaware in accordance with this section and the resulting cessation of its existence as a corporation of this State pursuant to a certificate of conversion to non-Delaware entity shall not be deemed to affect any obligations or liabilities of the corporation incurred prior to such conversion or the personal liability of any person incurred prior to such conversion, …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(e) (src:1362)
GIVEN `the obligation, liability or personal liability was incurred before the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the obligation or liability` MEANS
    IF `the obligation, liability or personal liability was incurred before the conversion`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

-- "nor shall it be deemed to affect the choice of law applicable to the corporation with respect to matters arising prior to such conversion."
-- src:1362 | nor shall it be deemed to affect the choice of law applicable to the corporation with respect to matters arising prior to such conversion.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(e) (src:1362)
GIVEN `the matter arose before the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 266(e) the conversion is not deemed to affect the choice of law applicable to the matter` MEANS
    IF `the matter arose before the conversion`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

§ `s 266(f) No winding up; no dissolution`

-- "Unless otherwise provided in a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with this section": the unless-clause is read as governing both limbs (fork F5).
-- src:1363 | (f) Unless otherwise provided in a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with this section, the converting corporation shall not be required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets, and the conversion shall not constitute a dissolution of such corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(f) (src:1363)
GIVEN `a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with the section provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(f) the converting corporation is not required to wind up its affairs or pay its liabilities and distribute its assets` MEANS
    NOT `a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with the section provides otherwise`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(f) (src:1363)
GIVEN `a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with the section provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(f) the conversion does not constitute a dissolution of the corporation` MEANS
    NOT `a resolution of conversion adopted in accordance with the section provides otherwise`

§ `s 266(g) Exchanging, converting or cancelling shares of stock`

-- src:1364 | (g) In connection with a conversion of a domestic corporation to another entity pursuant to this section, shares of stock of the corporation of this State which is to be converted may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the entity to which the corporation of this State is being converted or, in addition to or in lieu thereof, may be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, another domestic corporation or other entity or may be cancelled.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(g) (src:1364)
DECLARE `s 266(g) Treatment of shares of stock of the corporation` IS ONE OF
    `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the entity to which the corporation is being converted`
    `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, another domestic corporation or other entity`
    `cancelled under s 266(g)`
    `any treatment that subsection (g) does not list`

-- The three treatments the subsection lists are permitted. Any other treatment is not covered by the subsection (NOTHING).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(g) (src:1364)
GIVEN treatment IS A `s 266(g) Treatment of shares of stock of the corporation`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 266(g) the treatment is permitted in connection with a conversion` MEANS
    CONSIDER treatment
    WHEN `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the entity to which the corporation is being converted` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `exchanged for or converted into cash, property, shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, another domestic corporation or other entity` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `cancelled under s 266(g)` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 266(h) The effect of a conversion on rights, property and debts`

-- src:1365 | (h) When a corporation has been converted to another entity or business form pursuant to this section, the other entity or business form shall, for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware, be deemed to be the same entity as the corporation. …
-- src:1365 | When any conversion shall have become effective under this section, for all purposes of the laws of the State of Delaware, all of the rights, privileges and powers of the corporation that has converted, and all property, real, personal and mixed, and all debts due to such corporation, as well as all other things and causes of action belonging to such corporation, shall remain vested in the other entity or business form to which such corporation has converted and shall be the property of such other entity or business form, and the title to any real property vested by deed or otherwise in such corporation shall not revert or be in any way impaired by reason of this chapter; …
-- src:1365 | but all rights of creditors and all liens upon any property of such corporation shall be preserved unimpaired, and all debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation that has converted shall remain attached to the other entity or business form to which such corporation has converted, and may be enforced against it to the same extent as if said debts, liabilities and duties had originally been incurred or contracted by it in its capacity as such other entity or business form. …
-- src:1365 | The rights, privileges, powers and interest in property of the corporation that has converted, as well as the debts, liabilities and duties of such corporation, shall not be deemed, as a consequence of the conversion, to have been transferred to the other entity or business form to which such corporation has converted for any purpose of the laws of the State of Delaware.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(h) (src:1365)
DECLARE `s 266(h) Effect of a conversion that has become effective` IS ONE OF
    `the other entity or business form is deemed to be the same entity as the corporation under s 266(h)`
    `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the corporation remain vested in the other entity or business form under s 266(h)`
    `title to real property vested in the corporation does not revert or become impaired under s 266(h)`
    `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the corporation are preserved unimpaired under s 266(h)`
    `all debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation remain attached to the other entity or business form and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it in that capacity under s 266(h)`
    `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation are not deemed to have been transferred to the other entity or business form under s 266(h)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(h) (src:1365)
GIVEN `the conversion has become effective under the section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `s 266(h) Effect of a conversion that has become effective`
`s 266(h) the effects of the conversion` MEANS
    IF `the conversion has become effective under the section`
    THEN LIST `the other entity or business form is deemed to be the same entity as the corporation under s 266(h)`
            , `all rights, privileges and powers, all property and debts due and all things and causes of action of the corporation remain vested in the other entity or business form under s 266(h)`
            , `title to real property vested in the corporation does not revert or become impaired under s 266(h)`
            , `all rights of creditors and all liens upon property of the corporation are preserved unimpaired under s 266(h)`
            , `all debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation remain attached to the other entity or business form and may be enforced against it as if incurred by it in that capacity under s 266(h)`
            , `the rights, property, debts, liabilities and duties of the corporation are not deemed to have been transferred to the other entity or business form under s 266(h)`
    ELSE EMPTY

@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(h) (src:1365)
GIVEN effect IS A `s 266(h) Effect of a conversion that has become effective`
      `the conversion has become effective under the section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(h) the effect follows from the conversion` MEANS
    elem effect (`s 266(h) the effects of the conversion` `the conversion has become effective under the section`)

§ `s 266(i) No stockholder vote where no shares have been issued`

-- src:1366 | (i) No vote of stockholders of a corporation shall be necessary to authorize a conversion if no shares of the stock of such corporation shall have been issued prior to the adoption by the board of directors of the resolution approving the conversion.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(i) (src:1366)
GIVEN `no shares of the stock of the corporation had been issued before the board of directors adopted the resolution approving the conversion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(i) no vote of stockholders is necessary to authorize the conversion` MEANS
    `no shares of the stock of the corporation had been issued before the board of directors adopted the resolution approving the conversion`

§ `s 266(j) Charitable nonstock corporations`

-- Nothing in the section authorizes the conversion of a charitable nonstock corporation into another entity if its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired.
-- Whether the status would be lost or impaired is a plain input: the text names nobody who decides it (fork F9).
-- src:1367 | (j) Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the conversion of a charitable nonstock corporation into another entity, if the charitable status of such charitable nonstock corporation would thereby be lost or impaired.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(j) (src:1367)
GIVEN kind IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(j) the section does not authorize the conversion of the charitable nonstock corporation` MEANS
        `the kind is a charitable nonstock corporation` kind
    AND `its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired`

§ `s 266(k) Restrictions on a merger or consolidation that apply to a conversion`

-- "August 1, 2022": the date before which the corporation must have been incorporated (certificate of incorporation provisions), and on or before which the written agreement must have been in effect.
-- src:1368 | (k) Any provision of the certificate of incorporation of a corporation incorporated before August 1, 2022, or any provision in any voting trust agreement or other written agreement between or among any such corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders in effect on or before August 1, 2022, …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(k) (src:1368)
`s 266(k) the date August 1, 2022` MEANS YearMonthDay 2022 8 1

DECLARE `s 266(k) Where the restriction on a merger or consolidation sits` IS ONE OF
    `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)`
    `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)`

-- A provision of the certificate of incorporation of a corporation incorporated before August 1, 2022, or a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between or among any such
-- corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders in effect on or before August 1, 2022, that restricts, conditions or prohibits the consummation of a merger or consolidation, is deemed to apply to a
-- conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation, unless the certificate of incorporation or the agreement expressly provides otherwise. "Any such corporation" is read as a corporation incorporated
-- before August 1, 2022 (fork F13); the two dates differ: "before" for the incorporation, "on or before" for the agreement.
-- src:1368 | (k) Any provision of the certificate of incorporation of a corporation incorporated before August 1, 2022, or any provision in any voting trust agreement or other written agreement between or among any such corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders in effect on or before August 1, 2022, that restricts, conditions or prohibits the consummation of a merger or consolidation shall be deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation unless the certificate of incorporation or such agreement expressly provides otherwise.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(k) (src:1368)
GIVEN where IS A `s 266(k) Where the restriction on a merger or consolidation sits`
      `the date the corporation was incorporated` IS A DATE
      `the date the agreement came into effect` IS A DATE
      `the provision restricts, conditions or prohibits the consummation of a merger or consolidation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate of incorporation or the agreement expressly provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(k) the provision is deemed to apply to a conversion as if it were a merger or consolidation` MEANS
        `the provision restricts, conditions or prohibits the consummation of a merger or consolidation`
    AND (NOT `the certificate of incorporation or the agreement expressly provides otherwise`)
    AND (CONSIDER where
         WHEN `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)`
              THEN `the date the corporation was incorporated` LESS THAN `s 266(k) the date August 1, 2022`
         WHEN `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)`
              THEN    `the date the corporation was incorporated` LESS THAN `s 266(k) the date August 1, 2022`
                  AND `the date the agreement came into effect` AT MOST `s 266(k) the date August 1, 2022`)

§ `s 266(l) The plan of conversion`

-- The converting corporation may adopt a plan of conversion that may state five things.
-- src:1369 | (l) In connection with a conversion under this section, the converting corporation may adopt a plan of conversion that may state: (i) the terms and conditions of the conversions, (ii) that the document, instrument, agreement or other writing, as the cause may be, governing the internal affairs of the entity to which the converting corporation is being converted and the conduct of its business shall be as set forth in an attachment to the plan of conversion, (iii) the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock of the converting corporation which are to be exchanged for or converted into cash, property, or shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, the entity to which the corporation of this State is being converted or, in addition to or in lieu thereof, cash, property, shares of stock, rights or securities of, or interests in, another domestic corporation or other entity or cancelling such shares, in accordance with subsection (g) of this section, (iv) any details or provisions as are deemed desirable, and (v) such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the entity to which the corporation of this State is being converted. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(l) (src:1369)
DECLARE `s 266(l) Matter a plan of conversion may state` IS ONE OF
    `the terms and conditions of the conversion under s 266(l)(i)`
    `that the document governing the internal affairs of the entity to which the corporation is being converted shall be as set forth in an attachment to the plan under s 266(l)(ii)`
    `the manner, if any, of exchanging or converting shares of stock of the converting corporation under s 266(l)(iii)`
    `any details or provisions that are deemed desirable under s 266(l)(iv)`
    `such other provisions or facts as shall be required to be set forth in a plan of conversion by the laws applicable to the entity to which the corporation is being converted under s 266(l)(v)`
    `any matter that subsection (l) does not list`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(l) (src:1369)
GIVEN matter IS A `s 266(l) Matter a plan of conversion may state`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 266(l) the plan of conversion may state the matter` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    WHEN `any matter that subsection (l) does not list` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- A term of the plan may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan, provided that the manner in which the facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan.
-- (The sentence after it, on what "facts" includes, is the next rule.)
-- src:1369 | Any of the terms of the plan of conversion may be made dependent upon facts ascertainable outside of such plan, provided that the manner in which such facts shall operate upon the terms of the plan of conversion is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan of conversion. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(l) (src:1369)
GIVEN `the term depends on facts ascertainable outside the plan` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the manner in which those facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 266(l) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the plan` MEANS
        (NOT `the term depends on facts ascertainable outside the plan`)
    OR  `the manner in which those facts operate on the term is clearly and expressly set forth in the plan`

-- The sentence after it: "The term “facts,” as used in the preceding sentence, includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation of this State is being converted or the converting corporation."
-- "Includes, but is not limited to" makes the list of facts open; it does not make everything a fact. An event, and a determination or action by any person or body
-- (including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation), are facts; for anything else the text does not say, so the rule answers NOTHING (fork F26).
-- src:1369 | The term “facts,” as used in the preceding sentence, includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including determination or action by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation of this State is being converted or the converting corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(l) (src:1369)
DECLARE `s 266(l) Kind of fact` IS ONE OF
    `the occurrence of an event under s 266(l)`
    `a determination by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation, under s 266(l)`
    `an action by any person or body, including the entity to which the corporation is being converted or the converting corporation, under s 266(l)`
    `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 266(l)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 266(l) (src:1369)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 266(l) Kind of fact`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 266(l) the kind of fact is within the term facts` kind MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 266(l)` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
